  "reason": "The NVIDIA CDI specification of the c8s v0.33.2 node image mounts these two files from the node root into /usr/bin of every GPU container. The source is the measured, dm-verity node image root, not operator content. c8s lint treats every host mount as operator-supplied (internal/cmds/allowlist/lint.go, searchPathFindings). CDS does not enforce this rule on write.",
